flowchart LR
 A[Authorized care role] --> B[Patient and justification] --> C{Eligible and auditable?}
 C -->|No| D[Deny]
 C -->|Yes| E[Finite read-only grant]
 E --> F[Audit incident and patient notification]
 F --> G[Scoped record access]
 G --> H[Expiry or revocation]
 H --> I[Officer review]